### -----------------------------
### USER CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS (/profiles and /leaderboards)
### -----------------------------

### Get all users (with onboarding completed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Get user profile + notes by username
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/{username}
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Search users by username or name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/search?q=john
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Get users by college
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/college/{collegeName}
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>





### -----------------------------
### NOTE CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS (/my-notes and /browse-notes)
### -----------------------------

### Create a new note (upload option)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
  "title": "Mathematics Notes",
  "pdfLink": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/math_notes.pdf",
  "tags": ["math", "calculus", "algebra"],
  "pdfOption": "upload"
}

### Create a new note (link option)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
  "title": "Linear Algebra - Lecture 1",
  "pdfLink": "https://example.com/linear_algebra.pdf",
  "tags": ["math", "linear-algebra"],
  "pdfOption": "link"
}

### Get All Notes (for logged-in user)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Get Single Note by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Delete Note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Browse Notes (search + pagination)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/browse?query=spring&tag=java&page=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Browse All notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/browse
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0cmFpbmVkYm90MTBrQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzU3NDE0Mzk5LCJleHAiOjE3NTc1MDA3OTl9.acTQeC6h9pIujklgnvGiUntAYtZ_kCXljmfiOv7-PPs

### Search Notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/search?query=algorithms&tag=dsa&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Paginated Notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/page?query=python&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Get Saved Notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/saved
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Get Liked Notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/liked
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Like Note
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1/like
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Unlike Note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1/like
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Save Note
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1/save
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Unsave Note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1/save
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>





